 SystemExit('target block not found')\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> s = s.replace(old, new)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> p.write_text(s)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> PY\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
